  message: "Stale at filing — work shipped before the tracker item was closed. Producer migration: commit 9071f774 (refactor(symbol_kinds): WI-nitil — grpc + mq Cluster D fold + audit-findings 0013 correction) folded all five gRPC kinds (grpc_server/stub/service/servicer/client) and both MQ kinds (mq_publisher/mq_subscriber) to canonical Cluster A constructs + meta['framework_role']; added the three previously-unregistered values (grpc_service/grpc_servicer/grpc_client) to symbol_kinds.py AXIS_ENDPOINT_SHAPE. Audit-findings 0013 advance: commit 6d6fc8df (docs(audits): advance 0013 + 0014 rows UNRESOLVED -> PRELIM_RESOLVED) flipped all 28 advancing rows once empirical re-grep confirmed zero live producers. The five remaining zero-producer placeholders (ipc_subscriber, websocket_emitter, websocket_listener, rpc, service) re-verified clean. The structural fix to the diagnostic-test blind spot itself (assignment-form trace in producer-coherence linter) shipped at commit c4cc2d5d (WI-nubuv ext A)."  # 1693
